host players (react-native-theoplayer) re-stamp their internal"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"player frame from the host view’s "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"frame"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" on every layout pass"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"code":"THEOplayerRCTView.layoutSubviews","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" does "},{"code":"player.frame = self.frame","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"While the split transform is installed, the host view’s frame is the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"transformed bounding box, so each pass applies the layout fraction to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"picture a SECOND time — the content renders at fraction² of its box — and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"drifts the picture out of the frozen content mask, exposing black regions"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"inside the box. react-native-video is immune: its layout stamps sublayers"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from "},{"code":"bounds","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", which a transform never changes."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The lock captures the healthy pre-transform frame at acquisition and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"re-asserts it (through the host’s own frame API, via "},{"code":"restamp","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") whenever"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the surface’s layer geometry deviates. Observed on the LAYER: UIView"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"geometry setters are not KVO-compliant, CALayer’s "},{"code":"bounds","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"\/"},{"code":"position","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"— the same technique as the overlay host view’s host-layer observers."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Construct on the main thread (it reads and may re-stamp view geometry);"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"release","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" only invalidates the observations and is safe from any thread."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"references":{"doc://optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime/documentation/OptiViewAdsRuntime/ContentLayoutLock/init(internalView:desiredFrame:restamp:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/optiviewadsruntime\/contentlayoutlock\/init(internalview_desiredframe_restamp_)","type":"topic","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsRuntime\/ContentLayoutLock\/init(internalView:desiredFrame:restamp:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"internalView","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"UIView","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)UIView"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"desiredFrame","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"CGRect","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@S@CGRect"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"restamp","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"CGRect","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@S@CGRect"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Void","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"init(internalView:desiredFrame:restamp:)"},"doc://optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime/documentation/OptiViewAdsRuntime":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/optiviewadsruntime","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The iOS and tvOS runtime of the OptiView Ads SDK: the AVFoundation content-player adapter, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"overlay ad renderer, and the Google IMA integrations."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsRuntime","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","title":"OptiViewAdsRuntime"},"doc://optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime/documentation/OptiViewAdsRuntime/ContentLayoutLock/release()":{"role":"symbol","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"release()","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"release","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"()","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Stops holding the frame. The host’s next layout pass re-stamps its own","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"geometry from the (by then restored) host view frame."}],"url":"\/documentation\/optiviewadsruntime\/contentlayoutlock\/release()","identifier":"doc:\/\/optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsRuntime\/ContentLayoutLock\/release()"},"doc://optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime/documentation/OptiViewAdsRuntime/ContentLayoutLock":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ContentLayoutLock","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"ContentLayoutLock","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ContentLayoutLock","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Pins a host player’s internal video surface to a fixed frame while the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"split-layout reflow has a transform installed on the host view (PLAYG-513).","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/optiviewadsruntime\/contentlayoutlock","identifier":"doc:\/\/optiviewadsruntime.OptiViewAdsRuntime\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsRuntime\/ContentLayoutLock"}}}